        {
          "field": "summary",
          "value": "Blood Omen 2 is a third-person action game and the second installment in the Legacy of Kain series. Players control the vampire Kain as he travels through Nosgoth, using combat, stealth, exploration, and puzzle-solving to progress.\n\nAs the story unfolds, Kain gains new vampiric abilities that allow him to access previously inaccessible areas and confront stronger enemies. The game follows his attempt to regain power and establish control over Nosgoth.",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary_es",
          "value": "Blood Omen 2 es un juego de acción en tercera persona y la segunda entrega de la saga Legacy of Kain. Los jugadores controlan al vampiro Kain mientras recorre Nosgoth, usando el combate, el sigilo, la exploración y la resolución de acertijos para avanzar.\n\nA medida que avanza la historia, Kain adquiere nuevas habilidades vampíricas que le permiten acceder a zonas antes inaccesibles y enfrentarse a enemigos más poderosos. El juego sigue su intento de recuperar el poder y establecer el control sobre Nosgoth.",
          "source": "claude",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "year",
          "value": "2002",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        }
