          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary",
          "value": "Blood Omen: Legacy of Kain is a top-down action-adventure video game with role-playing game elements. It is the first game in the Legacy of Kain series, and the only one developed by Silicon Knights and published by Crystal Dynamics. The game was first released in 1996 for the PlayStation, and later ported to Microsoft Windows. A Sega Saturn version was announced during production but later cancelled before release. It was followed by four sequels, which were all developed by Crystal Dynamics and published by Eidos Interactive.",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary_es",
          "value": "Blood Omen: Legacy of Kain es un videojuego de acción y aventura en vista cenital con elementos de juego de rol. Es el primer título de la saga Legacy of Kain y el único desarrollado por Silicon Knights y publicado por Crystal Dynamics. El juego salió por primera vez en 1996 para PlayStation y luego se adaptó a Microsoft Windows. Durante su producción se anunció una versión para Sega Saturn, pero se canceló antes de su lanzamiento. Le siguieron cuatro secuelas, todas desarrolladas por Crystal Dynamics y publicadas por Eidos Interactive.",
          "source": "claude",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "year",
          "value": "1996",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        }
      ],
